      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "* How Many Times Recursion Exists?\n=> Only ONE recursion exists\nBut it has:\n\n1 Call phase\n2 Return phase\n\nThese are not types, they are execution phases.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "* How Many Times Recursion Exists?\n=> Only ONE recursion exists\nBut it has:\n\n1 Call phase\n2 Return phase\n\nThese are not types, they are execution phases.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "D1fgTNiRQ1-S8OjQibm1d",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 347,
      "y": 1455.465160369873,
      "width": 675.6392822265625,
      "height": 875,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
